	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a domino per Iesum Christum, servatorem nostrum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Miraris forte, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ut charitatis ratio poscit, venerande frater, qualis sit status <placeName ref="l320">Memmingensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ecclesie in tanta omnium rerum turba.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Haeremus adhuc in dubio, quid no<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>biscum acturus sit dominus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Pontificii extrema minantur, ubi dominus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>illis pro voto suo concesserit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Dum hęc scribo, Hyspanicus miles<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Kollektiver Singular.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tentat nostram urbem inhabitare, pro sua libidine grassari in quosvis <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>pios, ut huius gentis mos est.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nostri <placeName ref="l18">Augustam</placeName> abierunt, si deo visum est, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>apud cęsarem<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> propositum hoc mitigare;<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Zum <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> Reichstag entsandten die Memminger u.a. die Ratsherren <persName ref="p7223">Christoph Zwicker</persName> und <persName ref="p18389">Wilhelm Besserer</persName>; s. Peer <hi>Frieß,</hi> Die Außenpolitik der Reichsstadt <placeName ref="l320">Memmingen</placeName> in der Reformationszeit (1517-1555), Memmingen 1993, S. 207-209. - Die Einquartierung des <placeName ref="l875">spanischen</placeName> Kriegsvolks konnte durch Freikauf abgewendet werden; s. <hi>Frieß,</hi> aaO, S. 208 mit Anm. 36; <bibl source="b480">PC</bibl> IV/2 763, Nr. 667. Die Aufwendungen dafür beliefen sich laut Christoph <hi>Schorer,</hi> <placeName ref="l320">Memminger</placeName> Chronik, <placeName ref="l320">Memmingen</placeName> 1660, S. 85. 87, auf 30000 Gulden. Auch wenn dieser Betrag fragwürdig erscheinen mag, da <placeName ref="l320">Memmingen</placeName> gerade damals versuchte, seine Buße von 80000 auf 50000 Gulden zu verringern (s. <ref target="file12934">Nr. 2885</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17152-1" type="qv"/>) und <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> in <ref target="file13069">Nr. 3020</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17288-4" type="qv"/>, den wohl zu geringen Betrag von nur 3000 Gulden anführt, wird Schorers Angabe vermutlich richtig sein; vgl. nämlich <ref target="file13069">Nr. 3020</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17288-3" type="qv"/>.<ptr target="zfnfn17268-1" type="zfn"/></note> quod ubi non contigerit, actum <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>est de nobis et religione et liberis et bonis.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l45">Bibraci</placeName> inmaniter <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>saeviunt<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Als Subjekt sind die in <placeName ref="l45">Biberach</placeName> stationierten kaiserlichen Soldaten vorauszusetzen; s. dazu <ref target="file13044">Nr. 2995</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17261-9" type="qv"/>. - Etwas später konnte die Stadt diese gegen Zahlungen loswerden; s. <bibl source="b480">PC</bibl> IV/2 763, Nr. 667 (vom 18. September).</note>; Ulmę et miles et pestis grassantur;<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Zur Besatzung in <placeName ref="l513">Ulm</placeName> s. etwa <bibl source="b22">HBBW XIX</bibl> 433; <ref target="file12934">Nr. 2885</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17152-4" type="qv"/>. - Zum dortigen Pestausbruch s. <ref target="file13007">Nr. 2958</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17224-2" type="qv"/>; <ref target="file13017">Nr. 2968</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17233-5" type="qv"/>.</note> <placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName> antichristu<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>s fere regnat.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Furit <placeName ref="l875">Hispanus</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Dentibus frendit <placeName ref="l822">Germanicus</placeName> miles.<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Siehe dazu <ref target="file13054">Nr. 3005</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17272-3" type="qv"/>.</note><pb type="edition" next="441"/></s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Interim cardinales et episcopi egregie, si diis placet, pro oplendo <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>marsupio laborant.<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Zu den Entschädigungsforderungen des <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> Bischofs Kardinal <persName ref="p7840">Otto Truchsess von Waldburg</persName> s. z.B. <bibl>Roth, Augsburg</bibl> IV 16-21.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Utinam adesset dies ille ultimus domini, quo classi<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>cum cantaturus est Christus per gloriosum adventum eius!<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 24, 31</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>1Kor 15, 52</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Apok 10, 7; 11, 15</ref></cit>.</note></s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Ego non video, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>qua via piis consuli possit rebus tam undique deploratissimis.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Variis ex coniecturis licet divinari futurum bellum adversus <placeName ref="l257">Constantienses</placeName>;<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Vgl. <ref target="file12967">Nr. 2918</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17184-2" type="qv"/>, <ref target="file13054">Nr. 3005</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17272-4" type="qv"/>; und unten Z. <ptr target="qvzl17268-4" type="qv"/>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>nam sic sensim caesar militem parare videtur, ut qui indiem pro<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>pius accedat <placeName ref="l320">Memmingam</placeName>, <placeName ref="l907">Kampidunum</placeName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><placeName ref="l907">Kempten</placeName>.</note> et <placeName ref="l234">Isnen</placeName> versus.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Illuc enim<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> locaturus est<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> militem, <ptr target="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"/>ut tandem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>velocius irruat et velut ex inproviso.<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note></s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quid enim opus haberet adversus nos ullo <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>bellico apparatu (nisi vi aliqua ad veterum errorem nos cogere velit), <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>quam ut vel <placeName ref="l862">Helveticam</placeName> libertatem labefactare contendat aut sanctam <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><placeName ref="l257">Constantiensem</placeName> ecclesiam pęnitus excindat?</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Aiunt adhęc <persName ref="p8112">Gallum</persName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">König <persName ref="p8112">Heinrich II.</persName></note> ex <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>foedere convenire cum imperatore, forte ad hoc, ut felicius in proposito <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>pergat imperator.<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Ein falsches Gerücht. - Es erklärt sich durch die Anwesenheit einer französischen Gesandtschaft beim Kaiser in <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName>, die erst am 8. September vom Kaiser empfangen wurde; s. <ref target="file13072">Nr. 3023</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17291-6" type="qv"/>.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Fuit hisce diebus apud nos <placeName ref="l320">Memminge</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>nunctius quidam <placeName ref="l862">Helveticus</placeName> ab <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> veniens,<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Vielleicht der unbekannte <placeName ref="l862">eidgenössische</placeName> Bote, der das Antwortschreiben des Kaisers vom 28. Juli nach <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> befördert hatte (s. <ref target="file13033">Nr. 2984</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17249-1" type="qv"/>) oder, noch wahrscheinlicher, der in <ref target="file13032">Nr. 2983</ref>,[1], erwähnte Zuger Bote.</note> qui ore <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>rotundo in publica platea haec verba effutivit: „Caesar atrox <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>bellum movebit <placeName ref="l257">Constantiensibus</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l2448">Quinque Pagi</placeName> partes cesaris <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>iuvabunt atque illi viam parabunt permittentque illum <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>libere in suam terram exercitum ducere, ut <placeName ref="l257">Constantienses</placeName> expugnet“ <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>et similia; quę certe, si vera sunt, iam res vestrę (dolens loquor) <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>in ancipiti rerum statu positae sunt.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Cavete, optimi viri, proditionem, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>si fieri potest, nostro inenarrabili malo prudentiores facti!</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Sunt, qui <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>invideant vestrę libertati, maiorum sanguine partę,<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Vgl. <hi><persName ref="p4543">Cicero</persName>,</hi> De lege agraria orationes, 2, 16 ("sanguine vestrorum maiorum partam libertatem").</note> quam <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>tamen bono cuique viro usque ad mortem tueri licebit.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Rumor est <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>sclopeta<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>Schuler brachte vor der Zeile ein Zeigehändchen an, um die Wichtigkeit der Stelle zu unterstreichen.</hi></note><note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Schusswaffen; s. <bibl source="b353">Kirsch</bibl> 2552.</note> ex <placeName ref="l20">Inferiori Germania</placeName> versus <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName> vehi curribus, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>etc.<pb type="edition" next="442"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Nos adhuc apud nostros in vinea domini<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 20, 1-16</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>21, 28-41 par</ref></cit>.</note> ininpediti laboramus.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Missatores<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="17">die Messpfaffen.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>tamen omnem lapidem movent, ut nos infestent.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Ora dominum pro me <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>et ecclesia nostra, ne dominus nos a veritate divelli ullo pacto per<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>mittat.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Plura scribere non vacat.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Tantum admonitos vos volo, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>ut corda vestra preparetis ad insultus et sathane et mundi.<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Joh 16, 1f</ref></cit>.</note></s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Dominus <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>Iesus Christus misereatur nostri et avertat iram suam a nobis, quam non indigne ferimus.<ptr target="fne" type="footnote" n="e"/></s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Consolare me, si <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>fieri potest, multis nominibus adflictum.<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>Am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note></s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Alias corpore bene valeo una <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>cum tota familia.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div7" corresp="regest7">
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale, charissime frater, et uxorem tuam<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="19"><persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note> meo nomine <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>saluta plurimum, dominum <persName ref="p8011">Gvalterum</persName>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName> et <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName><note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note>, etc.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z45"/>Datę 28. augusti anno 1547.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Tuus vetus ille amicus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ornatissimo viro <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię antistiti <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>vigilantissimo, domino et fratri <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>charissimo, amico veteri, etc.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zurch</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>